      "description": "Search field with the implemented local field palette.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-workspace\"><input class=\"ds-search\" aria-label=\"Search tasks\" placeholder=\"Search tasks\" /></div>",
      "css": ".ds-workspace{--background:#f6f7f8;--foreground:#252a30;--surface:#ffffff;--surface-secondary:#eef0f2;--surface-tertiary:#e5e8ec;--muted:#626a74;--divider:#d9dee4;--accent:#35654e;--accent-foreground:#ffffff;--field-border:transparent;font-family:var(--font-geist-sans,Geist),sans-serif;color:var(--foreground)}@media(prefers-color-scheme:dark){.ds-workspace{--background:#191c20;--foreground:#e7e9ed;--surface:#24282e;--surface-secondary:#2d3239;--surface-tertiary:#383f48;--muted:#aab3bf;--divider:#414953;--accent:#9ec5ac;--accent-foreground:#17261d;}}.ds-search{max-width:256px;border:0;border-radius:12px;background:var(--surface-secondary);color:var(--foreground);padding:8px 12px;font:14px/20px var(--font-geist-sans,Geist),sans-serif;box-shadow:var(--field-shadow,0 1px 3px #00000014);transition:background-color 150ms ease}.ds-search::placeholder{color:var(--muted)}.ds-search:hover{background:var(--surface-tertiary)}.ds-search:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent);outline-offset:3px;background:var(--surface-secondary)}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-search{transition:none;animation:none}}"
